00:48:30.120 --> 00:48:38.270
don't you? Of course. Then you can't conscientiously object to the exhumation. No. No, Mr. O'Neil,

00:48:38.330 --> 00:48:48.050
I can't. If the man is guilty, he must be punished. Thank you, doctor. You'll hear from me one way or

00:48:48.050 --> 00:48:51.610
the other within the next few days. Thank you for your cooperation.

00:49:02.620 --> 00:49:16.210
I'm so worried, I didn't know what it happened to him.

00:49:16.210 --> 00:49:19.530
- Ben? - City.

