00:57:13.870 --> 00:57:17.940
People are talking about you and that nurse, Miss Jordan.

00:57:17.940 --> 00:57:20.340
How do you like my hair, Richard?

00:57:20.340 --> 00:57:23.150
Of course, I had to die.

00:57:23.150 --> 00:57:25.630
Everybody says it makes me look years younger.

00:57:25.630 --> 00:57:29.920
I can give her...

00:57:31.080 --> 00:57:36.310
four injections, then with the last one, an overdose.

00:58:08.190 --> 00:58:09.410
Lieutenant Stewart, please.

00:58:10.610 --> 00:58:15.550
Treatment itself consists of a series of shocks brought on by injections of insulin.

00:58:16.250 --> 00:58:21.220
The dosage and the degree of shock is gradually increased until we've reached what we feel

00:58:21.220 --> 00:58:23.400
is the limit the patient's system can stand.

00:58:24.100 --> 00:58:27.450
Well, if you do give Janet this insulin, how certain can you be that it'll help?

00:58:27.650 --> 00:58:30.000
