00:58:30.760 --> 00:58:35.300
If medicine were an exact science and not an art, I might be able to tell you.

00:58:36.110 --> 00:58:37.230
But you think there's a chance?

00:58:38.320 --> 00:58:39.020
Yes, I do.

00:58:41.960 --> 00:58:43.760
